Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:02.81,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,400)\c&H664F4F&\i1\pos(323,159)}Ninja Hattori-{\c&H1E5B5E&}kun + {\c&H576FAA&}Perman:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:02.81,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,400)\c&H696F6D&\pos(311,312)\frz1.249}ESPer wars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:09.19,Sign,,0,0,0,,Look forward to Heroics of Hattori-kun and Perman at New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now in theaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Set in New York, Hattori's ninja art and Perman's powers combine into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:51.50,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Kemumaki...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ken-{\i1}chan{\i0}, keep it up! That's the spirit!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, just you wait and watch!...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bluff while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.89,0:02:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe my controller broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being chased. Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no fear when I'm here for you. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird guys are coming here, Ken-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'll take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys? If you lay your hand on her, I won't ever forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll handle them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, in that case, I'll use this ninja flute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my! I'm shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, someone's calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinzō and others must have got into some kind of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:50.39,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,000)\c&H664F4F&\i1\fs42\pos(317.286,209.286)}Ninja Hattori-{\c&H4771CE&}kun {\c&H09523D&}+ {\c&H764B1D&}Perman:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:50.39,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,000)\c&H6646AE&\frz1.249\pos(309.857,426.286)}ESPer Wars
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's Ken'ichi and co. What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja art of !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja art of Paralysis, binding hand and foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Shibame, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over that girl peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That outfit, so you're Hattori-kun, a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just Hattori, my full name is Hattori Kanzō.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Will your ninja arts work against me, Psycho-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Psycho-man, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He can float in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He can move and fly also?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Without even using any ninja techniques?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surprised at only this much, you have lot of homework to do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Psycho-beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Hattori-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Peryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pako, take care of Hattori-kun and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Perman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Psycho teleportation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play tag with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use Shin-chan's ninja art of crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,3.. 2... 1... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinzō!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we have Shin-chan's crying power, we have nothing to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is... Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to Japan from Paris, only to get in such a scary situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do your parents do back at France?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"I came from Africa", he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My mum passed away 3 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was small, my parents got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother lived with my father, and I lived with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not in contact with my father or brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yuri-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you're looking for your father and brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, who is this Psycho-man who's after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you must be hungry, it's now lunch-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I want yakisoba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. I've only prepared curry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me... I want to help...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're our guest, leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunty, this plate right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, is curry done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing even compared to our ninja art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Telekinesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Yuri, what kind of training have you taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have taken no such training.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been able to perform more and more since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mysterious force that is yet to be explained by science, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Saikou-man, here we are at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools! Don't make me repeat myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.96,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.304,42.714)}Note: Saikou means Best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Saikou-man but Psycho-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Saikou-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to retrieve Yuri at all costs, who's the most prominent ESPer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That ninja kid Shinzo is an Expert psychokinetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon us, but what are you trying to do by obtaining ESPers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the only question that comes to your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the young ESPers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,At present their power is less. However, with time in training they become powerful ESPers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We will weaponise the ESPers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather all ESPers and unleash them upon the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall dominate the world. The entire world shall belong to me and my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, I understand. Yuri-{\i1}chan{\i0}, leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Hattori-{\i1}kun{\i0}, Perman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From tomorrow, we all will search for Yuri-chan's father and brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. But tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have day off, let's all search.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to appear on that show?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lead you to TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's be all for the naught if something were to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all send Yuri-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The World
